WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Length, mass and liquids

2
00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:09.967
Today at the market we measure things: length, mass and how much liquid.

3
00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:13.600
We measure the pencil with a ruler, starting at zero: it is twelve centimetres long.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.233
We weigh the bag of teff on a scale: it is three kilograms.

5
00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:20.867
The jerrycan holds five litres of water.

6
00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:24.800
We use metres and centimetres for length, kilograms for mass and litres for liquids.
